02:13:25,000 --> 02:13:31,000
Ava: "Well, we both have ladders to climb, and also... I would like to see what you do."

1792
02:13:31,000 --> 02:13:32,000
Virgil: "As in?"

1793
02:13:32,000 --> 02:13:40,000
Ava: "*sigh* You just want me to say it, don't you? I want to see you using your powers to fulfill your carnal needs."

1794
02:13:40,000 --> 02:13:46,000
Narrator: "Indeed, Ava was a huge pervert, and she knew she just hit the jackpot with Virgil."

1795
02:13:46,000 --> 02:13:51,000
Ava: "I'm certain that will not be off-putting to someone like you, am I right?"

1796
02:13:51,000 --> 02:13:54,000
Virgil: "Guess not, is just... unexpected."

1797
02:13:54,000 --> 02:13:56,000
Ava: "So, it's a deal then."

1798
02:13:56,000 --> 02:14:07,000
Ava: "Now, there is a lot for you to learn, but right now may not be the best moment for history dumping, but there are a few things you need to understand right now."

1799
02:14:07,000 --> 02:14:08,000
Virgil: "Sure thing."

1800
02:14:08,000 --> 02:14:17,000
Ava: "First, a few people are not just shielded against your magic, but if you also break their defenses, they will alarm the inquisition."

1801
02:14:17,000 --> 02:14:26,000
Ava: "That applies to me as well as others. Don't worry; I know pretty much everyone under this protection, so I can warn you in advance."

1802
02:14:26,000 --> 02:14:35,000
Ava: "It must be said... You can bypass them so that they don't trigger the alarm. One of them is if you just willingly open your mind."

1803
02:14:35,000 --> 02:14:41,000
Ava: "So long you don't try anything against their will, you can still let them inside."

1804
02:14:41,000 --> 02:14:42,000
Virgil: "I see..."

1805
02:14:42,000 --> 02:14:45,000
Ava: "Do you know what I mean by this?"

1806
02:14:45,000 --> 02:14:46,000
Virgil: "Eh?"

1807
02:14:46,000 --> 02:14:52,000
Ava: "I told you... I like mind control, so let's just say I can let you inside of me..."

1808
02:14:52,000 --> 02:14:58,000
Narrator: "It was quite obvious she was inviting Virgil to multiple things with that phrase."

1809
02:14:58,000 --> 02:15:08,000
Ava: "But you'll never be able to change me against my will. Although considering what I want too, I don't think you'll find any trouble with it."

1810
02:15:08,000 --> 02:15:09,000
Virgil: "ohh... Okay."

1811
02:15:09,000 --> 02:15:10,000
Ava: "Speechless, uh?"

1812
02:15:10,000 --> 02:15:21,000
Ava: "Now, to keep it brief, try not to use your powers just on anyone. I am certain you can use them on Laia with no consequence, and she'll make a great target practice."

1813
02:15:21,000 --> 02:15:25,000
Ava: "So for now, practice with her, Aldit, and me. "

1814
02:15:25,000 --> 02:15:35,000
Ava: "Once you get better at it, we can look for whom can be your next target, and once you get the gist of it, you'll be doing this on your own."

1815
02:15:35,000 --> 02:15:44,000
Ava: "Also, let me prepare a few things, so you can learn more about the history of this place and, more importantly, its threats to you."

1816
02:15:44,000 --> 02:15:50,000
Virgil: "Very well! I look forward to that. Can I still come and do my daily quests with you?"

1817
02:15:50,000 --> 02:15:53,000
Ava: "Of course, I look forward to that."

1818
02:15:53,000 --> 02:16:00,000
Ava: "For now, I have already opened my mind to you, so you'll be able to make a few changes here and there. "

1819
02:16:00,000 --> 02:16:07,000
Ava: "I wonder if I'll ever notice that I am changing, though... I guess we'll find out soon enough."

1820
02:16:07,000 --> 02:16:09,000
Virgil: "Heh, I guess so!"

1821
02:16:09,000 --> 02:16:16,000
Ava: "For now, that'd be all. Go and rest, Virgil, and don't ruin it, or you'll get both of us killed."

1822
02:16:16,000 --> 02:16:19,000
Virgil: "I won't! I swear! Taking it seriously now!"

1823
02:16:19,000 --> 02:16:21,000
Ava: "Good, take care then."

1824
02:16:21,000 --> 02:16:22,000
*......*

1825
02:16:22,000 --> 02:16:23,000
*...*

1826
02:16:23,000 --> 02:16:30,000
*I have been bonding with her a lot as of late; I feel like I can finally pierce through her barrier.*

1827
02:16:30,000 --> 02:16:37,000
Narrator: "After playing a few games with his friend, he found the right moment to try his advances. "

1828
02:16:37,000 --> 02:16:40,000
Virgil: "Hey, can you give me a minute?"

1829
02:16:40,000 --> 02:16:42,000
Laia: "Yes, what happened?"

1830
02:16:42,000 --> 02:16:48,000
Virgil: "You see... I want you to think about our friendship for a moment, focus on that..."

1831
02:16:48,000 --> 02:16:49,000
Laia: "Ehh?"

1832
02:16:49,000 --> 02:16:50,000
Virgil: "Just do it."

1833
02:16:50,000 --> 02:16:53,000
Laia: "Ahh... Okay... our friendship..."

1834
02:16:53,000 --> 02:16:57,000
*With her mind distracted, now I can focus on breaking through!*

1835
02:16:57,000 --> 02:17:04,000
Narrator: "The champion focused, and after exploring Laia's mind for a few minutes, he found a crack."

1836
02:17:04,000 --> 02:17:09,000
Virgil: "This is good enough; her will is not as strong as Aldit's or Ava's."

1837
02:17:09,000 --> 02:17:11,000
Virgil: "Just a little push and..."

1838
02:17:11,000 --> 02:17:16,000
Narrator: "Laia's barrier cracked, and soon, Virgil was inside her mind."

1839
02:17:16,000 --> 02:17:19,000
Virgil: "Yes! That was easy! Now, let's see..."

1840
02:17:19,000 --> 02:17:24,000
Narrator: "Virgil looked around, but when he saw Aldit approaching, he stopped."

1841
02:17:24,000 --> 02:17:27,000
Virgil: "*sigh* I better continue another day."

1842
02:17:27,000 --> 02:17:29,000
Virgil: "Okay, wake up, Laia!"

1843
02:17:29,000 --> 02:17:32,000
Laia: "Eh?! Yeah, is everything okay?"

1844
02:17:32,000 --> 02:17:36,000
Virgil: "Yeah, we were just about to play another round."

1845
02:17:36,000 --> 02:17:39,000
Laia: "Ah, yeah... ready to lose again? "

1846
02:17:39,000 --> 02:17:41,000
Virgil: "Heh, we'll see..."

1847
02:17:41,000 --> 02:17:42,000
*......*

1848
02:17:42,000 --> 02:17:43,000
*...*

1849
02:17:43,000 --> 02:17:48,000
Narrator: "As Virgil arrives at the Guild, she finds a very excited Ava."

1850
02:17:48,000 --> 02:17:51,000
Ava: "Virgil! Your license got here this morning."

1851
02:17:51,000 --> 02:17:55,000
Virgil: "That was fast; I thought it was going to take weeks."

1852
02:17:55,000 --> 02:18:02,000
Ava: "It usually would, but I can speed things up. So here it is; you can formally create a party now."

1853
02:18:02,000 --> 02:18:05,000
Virgil: "Great, so... how do I start?"

1854
02:18:05,000 --> 02:18:08,000
Ava: "You can do this by picking a name for it. "

1855
02:18:08,000 --> 02:18:10,000
Virgil: "Sure, I'll do that."

1856
02:18:10,000 --> 02:18:13,000
Ava: "So... The Bold, are you sure of that?"

1857
02:18:13,000 --> 02:18:14,000
Virgil: "Yes, I am!"

1858
02:18:14,000 --> 02:18:21,000
Ava: "Very well, I'll register it like that then. Now, the next step is to pick a location for it."

1859
02:18:21,000 --> 02:18:26,000
Ava: "It can't be the guild, and I wouldn't recommend your house either."

1860
02:18:26,000 --> 02:18:29,000
Virgil: "Would the tavern be a good place?"

1861
02:18:29,000 --> 02:18:33,000
Ava: "You definitely wouldn't be the first one to do that. "

1862
02:18:33,000 --> 02:18:36,000
Virgil: "Then, I guess that'd be our place. "

1863
02:18:36,000 --> 02:18:45,000
Ava: "'Great, that'd be all then! But since you and your friends are still low-level, don't expect to get any changeling quests soon. "

1864
02:18:45,000 --> 02:18:53,000
Virgil: "That's fine! For now, we should think about celebrating. I'll tell my friends; we can meet at the tavern tonight."

1865
02:18:53,000 --> 02:18:55,000
Ava: "Sure, I'll be there."

1866
02:18:55,000 --> 02:18:56,000
Virgil: "See ya then!"

1867
02:18:56,000 --> 02:18:57,000
Ava: "Take care!"

1868
02:18:57,000 --> 02:18:58,000
*......*

1869
02:18:58,000 --> 02:18:59,000
*...*

1870
02:18:59,000 --> 02:19:05,000
Narrator: "Virgil went around telling his friends and household about the good news."

1871
02:19:05,000 --> 02:19:13,000
Narrator: "Most of them couldn't believe how fast he achieved this, but so far, he had proven to be quite resourceful."

1872
02:19:13,000 --> 02:19:20,000
Narrator: "By night, those closest to him gathered at the tavern, which was closed to the public. "

1873
02:19:20,000 --> 02:19:28,000
Virgil: "Hello everyone! Thank you for coming! Today, Laia, Rowen, and I have been formally recognized as a party."

1874
02:19:28,000 --> 02:19:40,000
Virgil: "We know we have a rough path ahead; we are barely beginning our adventure, but we have proven ourselves to Ava and the guild, and if we do our best, I'm sure we'll succeed. "

1875
02:19:40,000 --> 02:19:45,000
Narrator: "Everyone cheered, thrilled to see Virgil's and his friends progress."

1876
02:19:45,000 --> 02:19:48,000
Virgil: "But that's enough! Let's have fun now!"

1877
02:19:48,000 --> 02:19:53,000
Narrator: "Virgil kept his speech short, a gesture welcomed by everyone. "

1878
02:19:53,000 --> 02:19:55,000
*I'm not that bad at speeches, am I?*

1879
02:19:55,000 --> 02:19:59,000
Narrator: "The party continued for the next few hours."

1880
02:19:59,000 --> 02:20:02,000
Narrator: "At midnight, Ava approached Virgil."

1881
02:20:02,000 --> 02:20:06,000
Narrator: "She had a smile on her face but looked concerned."

1882
02:20:06,000 --> 02:20:09,000
Virgil: "Hey Ava, everything is fine?"

1883
02:20:09,000 --> 02:20:13,000
Ava: "Yes, it's just, I was talking with your landlady."

1884
02:20:13,000 --> 02:20:16,000
Virgil: "Oh? And what do you think about it?"

1885
02:20:16,000 --> 02:20:19,000
Ava: "Well... that it might be a problem."

1886
02:20:19,000 --> 02:20:21,000
Virgil: "A problem?! Why?"

1887
02:20:21,000 --> 02:20:29,000
Ava: "I wasn't aware that she was a veteran from 'War of Succession.' She probably knows how to identify your kind of magic."

1888
02:20:29,000 --> 02:20:34,000
Ava: "It'd be just a matter of time if we don't do something about it."

1889
02:20:34,000 --> 02:20:37,000
Virgil: "Oh, what are we supposed to do?"

1890
02:20:37,000 --> 02:20:41,000
Ava: "There is only one advantage; the surprise factor."

1891
02:20:41,000 --> 02:20:48,000
Ava: "She trusts you. Even if she didn't, there is no reason to think you are one of the Autocrats."

1892
02:20:48,000 --> 02:20:53,000
*Autocrats... I need to research more about all of these things soon.*

1893
02:20:53,000 --> 02:21:00,000
Ava: "So even though it's dangerous, you need to enhance your relationship with her as soon as possible."

1894
02:21:00,000 --> 02:21:07,000
Ava: "If she fully trusts you, she'll think she is just being paranoid when she sees any danger signal."

1895
02:21:07,000 --> 02:21:13,000
Virgil: "Okay, I can do that then. I guess I'll pause my adventures for a few days."

1896
02:21:13,000 --> 02:21:21,000
Ava: "Yeah. Also, it'd be a good idea to do the same with your roommate... he seems smart and might notice something odd."

1897
02:21:21,000 --> 02:21:25,000
Virgil: "I agree... I'll take care of that immediately."

1898
02:21:25,000 --> 02:21:32,000
Ava: "Good, good. When you are done with that, we can see how to exploit your potential of yours."

1899
02:21:32,000 --> 02:21:34,000
Virgil: "I look forward to that."

1900
02:21:34,000 --> 02:21:42,000
Ava: "Heh, of course you. Now, let's go back to the party; we shouldn't look so serious in the middle of a celebration."

1901
02:21:42,000 --> 02:21:44,000
Virgil: "You are right; let's go!"

1902
02:21:44,000 --> 02:21:50,000
*From now on, you'll be able to find people around the city to interact with them.*

1903
02:21:50,000 --> 02:21:54,000
*You can check the journal to find more information about them!*

1904
02:21:54,000 --> 02:21:55,000
*......*

1905
02:21:55,000 --> 02:21:56,000
*...*

1906
02:21:56,000 --> 02:22:03,000
Narrator: "Virgil spent many days socializing and bonding with his landlady, increasing his influence on her."

1907
02:22:03,000 --> 02:22:12,000
Narrator: "Now, he has gathered enough power to break through her barriers, and he is ready to assure the safety of his future."

1908
02:22:12,000 --> 02:22:17,000
Virgil: "Sybil I have a few things to tell you. Do you have a minute?"

1909
02:22:17,000 --> 02:22:19,000
Sybil: "Yes, of course; what is it?"

1910
02:22:19,000 --> 02:22:21,000
Virgil: "Well, you see..."

1911
02:22:21,000 --> 02:22:29,000
Narrator: "He distracted her with a casual conversation, and with her guard down, he slowly started to probe her mind."

1912
02:22:29,000 --> 02:22:35,000
Narrator: "It took him a few exhausting minutes, but he had finally seen an opening."

1913
02:22:35,000 --> 02:22:40,000
Narrator: "And without hesitation, he used all of his will to break through it."

1914
02:22:40,000 --> 02:22:42,000
Virgil: "Do you hear me clearly?"

1915
02:22:42,000 --> 02:22:43,000
Sybil: "Yes, Virgil."

1916
02:22:43,000 --> 02:22:46,000
*Heh, it seems like I'm getting the hang of it!*

1917
02:22:46,000 --> 02:22:56,000
Virgil: "Okay. As your tenant, you know I can be of trust, so from now on, if you see that I do anything odd, it must be just your imagination."

1918
02:22:56,000 --> 02:23:03,000
Virgil: "Or, perhaps, just me growing up, but you won't think anything suspicious about it, got it?"

1919
02:23:03,000 --> 02:23:06,000
Sybil: "I understand. You are just growing up."

1920
02:23:06,000 --> 02:23:13,000
Virgil: "Exactly, and as an adult now, you can trust me more. We can be closer than we ever were..."

1921
02:23:13,000 --> 02:23:16,000
Sybil: "Yes... we are close, very close..."

1922
02:23:16,000 --> 02:23:21,000
Virgil: "Perfect. Let's continue with our casual conversation now..."

1923
02:23:21,000 --> 02:23:22,000
Sybil: "Yes..."

1924
02:23:22,000 --> 02:23:25,000
Sybil: "Eh? Sorry, did I say something?"

1925
02:23:25,000 --> 02:23:29,000
Virgil: "Ah, yes, we were talking about the other day, when..."

1926
02:23:29,000 --> 02:23:36,000
Narrator: "Virgil was slowly but surely forging his path to success, but this was but the first step."

1927
02:23:36,000 --> 02:23:37,000
*......*

1928
02:23:37,000 --> 02:23:38,000
*...*

1929
02:23:38,000 --> 02:23:48,000
Narrator: "Although his roommate wasn't a magical adept, both Ava and Virgil thought that his curious mind would notice that something is odd in the house."

1930
02:23:48,000 --> 02:23:58,000
Narrator: "Virgil diligently spent many days getting closer to him, and now that he has increased his trust in him, he was ready to make his move."

1931
02:23:58,000 --> 02:24:06,000
Virgil: "Hey, can you tell me about your latest invention again? I want to explain it to Laia, but it's kinda complicated."

1932
02:24:06,000 --> 02:24:09,000
Alistar: "Sure, so, the machine I am inventing..."

1933
02:24:09,000 --> 02:24:17,000
Narrator: "Alistar could spend hours talking about his latest ideas, which helped Virgil to probe his mind slowly."

1934
02:24:17,000 --> 02:24:24,000
Narrator: "Although he was very clever and smart, his ego was flawed, which allowed Virgil to find a weak spot."

1935
02:24:24,000 --> 02:24:25,000
*This is my chance!*

1936
02:24:25,000 --> 02:24:36,000
Narrator: "Using all of his willpower, Alistar's barriers broke down, and soon he was delighting himself with the many memories and thoughts of his roommate."

1937
02:24:36,000 --> 02:24:39,000
Virgil: "Heh, listen closely, Alistar."

1938
02:24:39,000 --> 02:24:41,000
Alistar: "Yes, Virgil?"

1939
02:24:41,000 --> 02:24:44,000
Virgil: "We are good roommates, aren't we? "

1940
02:24:44,000 --> 02:24:48,000
Virgil: "So, you will not interfere with anything I do. "

1941
02:24:48,000 --> 02:24:53,000
Virgil: "And, whatever you see our landlady doing or not, it's normal too, okay?"

1942
02:24:53,000 --> 02:24:57,000
Virgil: "Nothing strange is nor will happen in our household."

1943
02:24:57,000 --> 02:25:00,000
Alistar: "Everything... is... normal..."

1944
02:25:00,000 --> 02:25:02,000
Virgil: "Yes, exactly."

1945
02:25:02,000 --> 02:25:07,000
Virgil: "Now, keep behaving. Be a good boy, and you might be rewarded."

1946
02:25:07,000 --> 02:25:09,000
Alistar: "Be... a good boy..."

1947
02:25:09,000 --> 02:25:11,000
Virgil: "Heh, yes, just like that..."

1948
02:25:11,000 --> 02:25:18,000
Narrator: "With his roommate's loyalty assured, Virgil now could focus on other, more important matters."

1949
02:25:18,000 --> 02:25:22,000
Narrator: "And Ava would certainly be delighted with this news"

1950
02:25:22,000 --> 02:25:23,000
*......*

1951
02:25:23,000 --> 02:25:24,000
*...*

1952
02:25:24,000 --> 02:25:27,000
Narrator: "As Ava saw you arrive, she approached."

1953
02:25:27,000 --> 02:25:32,000
Ava: "Hey, I hope you are here to tell me that you took care of that."

1954
02:25:32,000 --> 02:25:35,000
Virgil: "Yes, I do! We are secure now."

1955
02:25:35,000 --> 02:25:42,000
Ava: "Great news then! I was getting worried about it. Now, let's discuss what we can do in the future..."

1956
02:25:42,000 --> 02:25:50,000
Narrator: "During the rest of the day, the two of them talked about what'd be the best way to use Virgil's powers."

1957
02:25:50,000 --> 02:25:58,000
Narrator: "It was a tricky situation since everyone who mattered in the city was usually protected against his magic."

1958
02:25:58,000 --> 02:26:08,000
Narrator: "Nonetheless, by manipulating the right people, he could probably get the advantage that he needs to get himself in a good position."

1959
02:26:08,000 --> 02:26:15,000
Narrator: "Before they realized, it was already night, and it was time for Virgil to come back home."

1960
02:26:15,000 --> 02:26:19,000
Narrator: "Then, from far away, they hear someone..."

1961
02:26:19,000 --> 02:26:21,000
*?????" "Help! Someone help!*

1962
02:26:21,000 --> 02:26:24,000
Virgil: "Eh?! Someone is calling for help!"

1963
02:26:24,000 --> 02:26:26,000
Ava: "That voice... is that-"

1964
02:26:26,000 --> 02:26:30,000
Narrator: "As they were approaching the door, Laia burst inside."

1965
02:26:30,000 --> 02:26:34,000
Narrator: "To Virgil and Ava shock, she was missing an arm."

1966
02:26:34,000 --> 02:26:35,000
Ava: "Laia!"

1967
02:26:35,000 --> 02:26:38,000
Virgil: "Holy- Your arm! What happened?!"

1968
02:26:38,000 --> 02:26:50,000
Narrator: "Once she was inside, she was about to fall, but Virgil caught her. Ava quickly closed the door behind her, but not without looking around first, trying to find any threat."

1969
02:26:50,000 --> 02:26:52,000
Virgil: "Ava, we need a medic!"

1970
02:26:52,000 --> 02:26:59,000
Narrator: "Although he couldn't see blood, he could only assume that she needed immediate attention."

1971
02:26:59,000 --> 02:27:00,000
Ava: "Yes, I'll call-"

1972
02:27:00,000 --> 02:27:04,000
Laia: "I-It's fine! I can... I can take care of this."

1973
02:27:04,000 --> 02:27:06,000
Virgil: "Laia, you shouldn't-"

1974
02:27:06,000 --> 02:27:13,000
Narrator: "The mushroom girl said a few words, and a powerful white light blinded everyone in it."

1975
02:27:13,000 --> 02:27:17,000
Narrator: "When it dissipated, her arm had grown again."

1976
02:27:17,000 --> 02:27:21,000
Laia: "Ahhh... D-Don't worry; my kind is very re-resilient..."

1977
02:27:21,000 --> 02:27:29,000
Narrator: "Although Laia was exhausted and could barely stand up, she did her best to endure and explain what just happened."

1978
02:27:29,000 --> 02:27:37,000
Laia: "I was assaulted by... I don't know; they didn't look like bandits; they wore odd masks and were covered in a cloak."

1979
02:27:37,000 --> 02:27:43,000
Laia: "They grabbed me; they didn't want my money or possessions, but to take me somewhere."

1980
02:27:43,000 --> 02:27:50,000
Laia: "Their grip was too tight, but I guess they didn't expect me to just... do this and run away."

1981
02:27:50,000 --> 02:27:54,000
Virgil: "That's horrible; we need to call the guards!"

1982
02:27:54,000 --> 02:27:56,000
Ava: "Yes, we should do that. "

1983
02:27:56,000 --> 02:28:04,000
Ava: "Laia, you can stay here and rest; this place is well defended, and you don't have to worry about your safety."

1984
02:28:04,000 --> 02:28:05,000
Laia: "I..."

1985
02:28:05,000 --> 02:28:08,000
Virgil: "Laia, come on, you look like..."

1986
02:28:08,000 --> 02:28:10,000
Virgil: "You really need to rest."

1987
02:28:10,000 --> 02:28:17,000
Narrator: "She hesitated because she wanted to help them, but in that condition, that'd be impossible."

1988
02:28:17,000 --> 02:28:21,000
Laia: "*sigh* Alright... I'll go to one of the bedrooms."

1989
02:28:21,000 --> 02:28:23,000
Ava: "Let me help you."

1990
02:28:23,000 --> 02:28:29,000
Narrator: "Ava helped her into one of the rooms and then put the place on high alert."

1991
02:28:29,000 --> 02:28:36,000
Narrator: "When she was done doing this, she grabbed Virgil to talk with him away from everyone else."

1992
02:28:36,000 --> 02:28:41,000
Ava: "This is bad, Virgil. This isn't the first report of kidnapping in the city."

1993
02:28:41,000 --> 02:28:42,000
Virgil: "Is not?"

1994
02:28:42,000 --> 02:28:48,000
Ava: "No, it's been going for a while, but for the most part, this has been kept secret."

1995
02:28:48,000 --> 02:28:54,000
Ava: "The church hired a party to investigate not long ago, but we haven't had news from them."

1996
02:28:54,000 --> 02:28:56,000
Virgil: "Then, what should we do?"

1997
02:28:56,000 --> 02:29:06,000
Ava: "Let's go to the church. Beatrice has been in charge of investigating this; now that they have attacked us directly, we need to be more involved."

1998
02:29:06,000 --> 02:29:14,000
Ava: "I'm sure she will be somewhat reluctant to have you there, but with your license and my support, that'd be no problem."

1999
02:29:14,000 --> 02:29:16,000
Virgil: "Okay, let's go then."

2000
02:29:16,000 --> 02:29:17,000
Ava: "Yes, let's."

2001
02:29:17,000 --> 02:29:18,000
*......*

2002
02:29:18,000 --> 02:29:19,000
*...*

2003
02:29:19,000 --> 02:29:27,000
Narrator: "Even though it was night, and Laia had just been assaulted, Ava and Virgil headed towards the church."

2004
02:29:27,000 --> 02:29:36,000
Narrator: "Both were nervous, wondering if someone was going to ambush them too, but to their luck, their journey was uneventful."

2005
02:29:36,000 --> 02:29:44,000
Narrator: "Once Ava explained the situation to the priestess, she reluctantly began sharing some of the information she had."

2006
02:29:44,000 --> 02:29:47,000
Narrator: "Her tone was one of frustration."

2007
02:29:47,000 --> 02:29:51,000
Beatrice: "We don't know much yet about this new threat... "

2008
02:29:51,000 --> 02:29:56,000
Beatrice: "What we know is that they have kidnapped half a dozen people already."

2009
02:29:56,000 --> 02:30:02,000
Beatrice: "They strike at night, and as your friend already told you, they all use masks."

2010
02:30:02,000 --> 02:30:08,000
Beatrice: "We believe they are a cult, but we have no clue about their intentions."

2011
02:30:08,000 --> 02:30:13,000
Beatrice: "I apologize for not being of help, but we are in the dark here too."

2012
02:30:13,000 --> 02:30:16,000
Ava: "*sigh* And what about the party you sent?"

2013
02:30:16,000 --> 02:30:22,000
Beatrice: "No idea, they never came back. I fear they might have been captured, or worse."

2014
02:30:22,000 --> 02:30:28,000
Ava: "So, what now? It seems they are getting bolder, and we can't hide this forever."

2015
02:30:28,000 --> 02:30:35,000
Beatrice: "We don't have many choices here; being far from the capital, we barely get any funds or support."

2016
02:30:35,000 --> 02:30:40,000
Beatrice: "I trust Shael; she's a great warrior and very cunning too. "

2017
02:30:40,000 --> 02:30:47,000
Beatrice: "But I can't send her alone, and there are not many parties capable or willing to help us."

2018
02:30:47,000 --> 02:30:50,000
Ava: "Well, that's why I brought Virgil here."

2019
02:30:50,000 --> 02:30:54,000
Beatrice: "Virgil? No disrespect, but he still is a rookie."

2020
02:30:54,000 --> 02:30:59,000
Ava: "Perhaps, but he has proven to me how capable he and his team is."

2021
02:30:59,000 --> 02:31:05,000
Ava: "And with Shael's expertise, they should at least be capable of doing some reconnaissance."

2022
02:31:05,000 --> 02:31:12,000
Narrator: "Ava was exaggerating; she knew Virgil hasn't shown that much yet, but she trusted his instincts."

2023
02:31:12,000 --> 02:31:21,000
Beatrice: "*sigh* Okay, that's true; we urgently need some information. Virgil, do you think you can do this without getting in trouble?"

2024
02:31:21,000 --> 02:31:24,000
Virgil: "I can be quite sneaky, sure, ma’am."

2025
02:31:24,000 --> 02:31:35,000
Beatrice: "Mmh... But this isn't going to be a single, one-afternoon adventure. This expedition may take you a few days, so you and everyone must prepare for that."

2026
02:31:35,000 --> 02:31:38,000
Beatrice: "Ava, can you help them to get ready?"

2027
02:31:38,000 --> 02:31:41,000
Ava: "Of course, is the least I can do."

2028
02:31:41,000 --> 02:31:46,000
Beatrice: "Then I'll talk with Shael and will... persuade her to cooperate."

2029
02:31:46,000 --> 02:31:51,000
Beatrice: "You'll part as soon as your preparations are done, Virgil."

2030
02:31:51,000 --> 02:31:54,000
Virgil: "Alright! I'll talk with the team."

2031
02:31:54,000 --> 02:31:59,000
Beatrice: "This is all for tonight then. See you soon, both of you."

2032
02:31:59,000 --> 02:32:02,000
Ava: "Try to rest, Beatrice, and see you soon."

2033
02:32:02,000 --> 02:32:06,000
Virgil: "Thanks for your confidence; I will not disappoint."

2034
02:32:06,000 --> 02:32:11,000
Beatrice: "I hope so... if anything, because your well-being is at stake here."

2035
02:32:11,000 --> 02:32:12,000
*......*

2036
02:32:12,000 --> 02:32:13,000
*...*

2037
02:32:13,000 --> 02:32:20,000
Narrator: "After Beatrice gave Virgil and his party guidelines, they went to the market to meet with Shael."

2038
02:32:20,000 --> 02:32:28,000
Narrator: "When they arrived, she was already there, and clearly, she was upset to be paired with the hero's party."

2039
02:32:28,000 --> 02:32:30,000
Virgil: "Shael! Are you ready?"

2040
02:32:30,000 --> 02:32:32,000
Shael: "You are late. Let's move."

2041
02:32:32,000 --> 02:32:37,000
Narrator: "He did his best to be friendly, but that wasn't going to work."

2042
02:32:37,000 --> 02:32:47,000
Narrator: "She turned around and walked towards the exit, where a mule-drawn wagon was waiting for your group, with enough provisions for a week."

2043
02:32:47,000 --> 02:32:52,000
Rowen: "Are we going to be gone for that long for this to be necessary?"

2044
02:32:52,000 --> 02:32:57,000
Shael: "Why? Is that a problem for you? If it's too much, you can stay."

2045
02:32:57,000 --> 02:32:59,000
Rowen: "No... just curious."

2046
02:32:59,000 --> 02:33:09,000
Shael: "It feels like an unnecessary question. Once we are out, keep your chitchat to the minimum; we don't want to attract unwanted attention."

2047
02:33:09,000 --> 02:33:10,000
Laia: "Yes, ma'am."

2048
02:33:10,000 --> 02:33:19,000
Narrator: "Laia behaved submissively, but Virgil suspected that she had something in mind, since this was not her usual nature."

2049
02:33:19,000 --> 02:33:26,000
Shael: "Alright, then there is no time to waste; the longer we take, the most likely they'll find out about us."

2050
02:33:26,000 --> 02:33:33,000
Narrator: "After the brief exchange, they left; whatever they were ready or not for what was going to be next. "

2051
02:33:33,000 --> 02:33:36,000
*Come on... do you have to be that pessimistic?*

2052
02:33:36,000 --> 02:33:39,000
Narrator: "Well, you'll see soon enough..."

2053
02:33:39,000 --> 02:33:40,000
*......*

2054
02:33:40,000 --> 02:33:41,000
*...*

2055
02:33:41,000 --> 02:33:48,000
Narrator: "Shael was leading the group when they left, and she kept a significant distance from the others."

2056
02:33:48,000 --> 02:33:53,000
Narrator: "And, as commanded, everyone in the group kept their voices down."

2057
02:33:53,000 --> 02:33:58,000
Narrator: "Laia had an idea, which she eagerly shared with her friends."

2058
02:33:58,000 --> 02:34:03,000
Laia: "Guys, let me deal with her; I'm sure I can befriend her. Just wait here."

2059
02:34:03,000 --> 02:34:07,000
Rowen: "Why do you think you can? Aren't we nice too?"

2060
02:34:07,000 --> 02:34:12,000
Laia: "Hah, you are a bunch of perverts, and she clearly doesn't like that."

2061
02:34:12,000 --> 02:34:15,000
Laia: "Meanwhile, I am a good girl, so..."

2062
02:34:15,000 --> 02:34:16,000
*Are you, though?*

2063
02:34:16,000 --> 02:34:19,000
Laia: "Wait here then, and don't be too noisy!"

2064
02:34:19,000 --> 02:34:20,000
Rowen: "Sure, ma'am."

2065
02:34:20,000 --> 02:34:22,000
Virgil: "Heh, good luck Laia."

2066
02:34:22,000 --> 02:34:26,000
Narrator: "As her friend walked away, Rowen approached Virgil."

2067
02:34:26,000 --> 02:34:29,000
Rowen: "So, what do you think? Will she succeed?"

2068
02:34:29,000 --> 02:34:30,000
Virgil: "No way!"

2069
02:34:30,000 --> 02:34:33,000
Rowen: "Hah, but at least she's brave to try."

2070
02:34:33,000 --> 02:34:35,000
Virgil: "That I give to her."

2071
02:34:35,000 --> 02:34:41,000
Rowen: "Our friend though... she might be a bitch, but what a nice pair she has, doesn't she?"

2072
02:34:41,000 --> 02:34:45,000
Virgil: "Yeah, well... it is a generous church, after all."

2073
02:34:45,000 --> 02:34:52,000
Rowen: "You know... My body doesn't really have a real shape. I could have a pair as big as hers if I wanted."

2074
02:34:52,000 --> 02:34:54,000
Rowen: "Would you like to see that?"

2075
02:34:54,000 --> 02:35:00,000
Narrator: "Rowen was clearly teasing Virgil, and trying to find what was his preference."

2076
02:35:00,000 --> 02:35:01,000
Virgil: "Well..."

2077
02:35:01,000 --> 02:35:05,000
Narrator: "With everything settled, they continued their journey."

2078
02:35:05,000 --> 02:35:13,000
Narrator: "A few hours later, and Virgil was venturing into the unknown; he hasn't been this far from the city yet."

2079
02:35:13,000 --> 02:35:20,000
Narrator: "Still, with the company of his friends and the skilled Shael, he wasn't afraid nor nervous."

2080
02:35:20,000 --> 02:35:32,000
Narrator: "As they moved further away from civilization, the roads got worse, and Laia, who was distracted by an adorable squirrel, tripped over a rock and fell to the ground."

2081
02:35:32,000 --> 02:35:34,000
Virgil: "Laia! Are you okay?!"

2082
02:35:34,000 --> 02:35:43,000
Narrator: "Our hero and his friends rushed to help her out, but as she was standing, her backpack opened, spilling its contents. "

2083
02:35:43,000 --> 02:35:44,000
Laia: "Ahhh?!"

2084
02:35:44,000 --> 02:35:46,000
Shael: "Uh? What's this..."

2085
02:35:46,000 --> 02:35:51,000
Narrator: "Shael noticed something and approached to have a closer look."

2086
02:35:51,000 --> 02:35:57,000
Narrator: "Laia was nervous, but she wasn't quick enough to hide whatever had fallen."

2087
02:35:57,000 --> 02:35:59,000
Shael: "Hey! These are drugs!"

2088
02:35:59,000 --> 02:36:04,000
Laia: "Mmmh! W-Well, I- They are components for potions! Nothing weird about it!"

2089
02:36:04,000 --> 02:36:07,000
Shael: "Come on, don't try to fool me."

2090
02:36:07,000 --> 02:36:08,000
Laia: "I..."

2091
02:36:08,000 --> 02:36:13,000
*Tensions are high; I should interfere before things keep heating up...*

2092
02:36:13,000 --> 02:36:19,000
Laia: "No, Shael is right; it was a bad idea. There is no need to worry; I won't be using them. "

2093
02:36:19,000 --> 02:36:29,000
Narrator: "Shael knew she was right, but she also realized how her attitude was affecting the team's morale and decided to soften up a little."

2094
02:36:29,000 --> 02:36:35,000
Shael: "No, maybe it's fine... just do it in the camp, and after you are done with your guard."

2095
02:36:35,000 --> 02:36:38,000
Narrator: "Laia smiled, grateful for Shael trying."

2096
02:36:38,000 --> 02:36:41,000
*This seems like a good moment to change the topic.*

2097
02:36:41,000 --> 02:36:46,000
Virgil: "Okay, it is getting late, so we need to keep going, right?"

2098
02:36:46,000 --> 02:36:51,000
Shael: "Yes, we need to find a good place to set up our camp soon. Let's go."

2099
02:36:51,000 --> 02:36:52,000
*......*

2100
02:36:52,000 --> 02:36:53,000
*...*

2101
02:36:53,000 --> 02:36:57,000
Narrator: "As night approached, Virgil and his team set up a camp."

2102
02:36:57,000 --> 02:37:05,000
Narrator: "Shael scouted the surroundings, and she was certain that the place was safe enough even to build a campfire."

2103
02:37:05,000 --> 02:37:10,000
Narrator: "Shael took a nap early to be able to stand guard at night."

2104
02:37:10,000 --> 02:37:16,000
Narrator: "By the time she woke up, Laia, Rowen, and Virgil were almost ready to go to sleep."

2105
02:37:16,000 --> 02:37:23,000
Shael: "Okay, I'll be close, all of you go to sleep soon since one of you will have to take my spot soon."

2106
02:37:23,000 --> 02:37:25,000
*Everyone" "Yes, ma'am!*

2107
02:37:25,000 --> 02:37:26,000
Shael: "Mmh... Good."

2108
02:37:26,000 --> 02:37:30,000
Narrator: "As the dark elf left, everyone started to gossip."

2109
02:37:30,000 --> 02:37:33,000
Virgil: "So... It's not going that bad, isn't it?"

2110
02:37:33,000 --> 02:37:36,000
Rowen: "I thought it was going to be worse."

2111
02:37:36,000 --> 02:37:41,000
Laia: "Yeah. She might be harsh, but at least she understands we are a team."

2112
02:37:41,000 --> 02:37:47,000
Narrator: "The group chit-chatted for a moment, and Rowen was the first to hit the sack."

2113
02:37:47,000 --> 02:37:52,000
Rowen: "Well... I am exhausted; I haven't walked this much in years! "

2114
02:37:52,000 --> 02:37:54,000
Virgil: "Alright, see ya, Rowen!"

2115
02:37:54,000 --> 02:37:56,000
Laia: "Have a good sleep!"

2116
02:37:56,000 --> 02:37:57,000
Rowen: "Thanks!"

2117
02:37:57,000 --> 02:38:00,000
Virgil: "So... are you going to sleep soon?"

2118
02:38:00,000 --> 02:38:03,000
Laia: "Yeah, I think so. How about you?"

2119
02:38:03,000 --> 02:38:07,000
Virgil: "I am not tired; I think I will go and check on Shael."

2120
02:38:07,000 --> 02:38:08,000
*...*

2121
02:38:08,000 --> 02:38:14,000
Narrator: "With his friends asleep, Virgil wandered into the forest, looking for Shael."

2122
02:38:14,000 --> 02:38:25,000
Narrator: "After ten minutes, he couldn't find any trace of her. He was getting worried, and as he was about to yell for her, he heard a whisper from a nearby tree."

2123
02:38:25,000 --> 02:38:27,000
Shael: "Shhh! You moron!"

2124
02:38:27,000 --> 02:38:28,000
Virgil: "Eh? Sha-"

2125
02:38:28,000 --> 02:38:32,000
Narrator: "Unexpectedly, Shael came back from a tree, fully naked."

2126
02:38:32,000 --> 02:38:33,000
Virgil: "Wha-"

2127
02:38:33,000 --> 02:38:35,000
Shael: "Shut up, Virgil!"

2128
02:38:35,000 --> 02:38:36,000
Virgil: "B-"

2129
02:38:36,000 --> 02:38:41,000
Shael: "But what? Don't you know dark elves need moonlight to survive too?"

2130
02:38:41,000 --> 02:38:43,000
Virgil: "I-... I kinda forgot."

2131
02:38:43,000 --> 02:38:47,000
Shael: "Whatever. I am not the first woman you see naked, am I?"

2132
02:38:47,000 --> 02:38:48,000
Virgil: "Ehh? N-No..."

2133
02:38:48,000 --> 02:38:58,000
Shael: "Then act with maturity. And go back to the camp. I told you I was going to make guard and that you and your friends needed to go to sleep."

2134
02:38:58,000 --> 02:39:03,000
Virgil: "Ahh... Yes, ma'am, I just wanted to see if you were alright."

2135
02:39:03,000 --> 02:39:12,000
Shael: "If I weren't, you would have no chance to do anything about it. So now rest, and hope that I am the one waking you up next. "

2136
02:39:12,000 --> 02:39:15,000
Virgil: "*Gulp* Alright, see you later."

2137
02:39:15,000 --> 02:39:25,000
Narrator: "Virgil went back to sleep, and although the conversation was intense, he was quite delighted to see the dark elf's naked body for the first time."

2138
02:39:25,000 --> 02:39:31,000
Narrator: "His dreams were all about that, and about what he could do to such a ripe body..."

2139
02:39:31,000 --> 02:39:32,000
*......*

2140
02:39:32,000 --> 02:39:33,000
*...*

2141
02:39:33,000 --> 02:39:40,000
Narrator: "After Virgil went to sleep, the rest of the night was quite calm, without any highlight."

2142
02:39:40,000 --> 02:39:45,000
Narrator: "Although only Shael and Laia seemed to have some experience camping."

2143
02:39:45,000 --> 02:39:55,000
Narrator: "It took them a few days to reach their destination, where Shael's guide was crucial to keep them on the route and secure from ambushes."

2144
02:39:55,000 --> 02:40:04,000
Narrator: "And then, after the experienced adventurer found a few suspicious tracks, Virgil group followed them until they found a cave."

2145
02:40:04,000 --> 02:40:08,000
Virgil: "So, do you think this is where are they hiding?"

2146
02:40:08,000 --> 02:40:13,000
Shael: "Perhaps... But this is odd; I never heard about this cave before."

2147
02:40:13,000 --> 02:40:24,000
Shael: "A formation like this should have been known already; even if not on maps, there are explorers, hunters... someone should have seen it before and mentioned it. "

2148
02:40:24,000 --> 02:40:26,000
Laia: "What does this mean, then?"

2149
02:40:26,000 --> 02:40:31,000
Shael: "It means... It might be new. But it doesn't look like a mine."

2150
02:40:31,000 --> 02:40:40,000
Rowen: "Mmmh... from where I am, there were some creatures that could build something like this, but... I don't think they'll go this far."

2151
02:40:40,000 --> 02:40:44,000
Shael: "Whatever the case, I think we need to get inside."

2152
02:40:44,000 --> 02:40:49,000
Virgil: "I agree. Even if it's dangerous, I don't think there is much choice."

2153
02:40:49,000 --> 02:40:52,000
Laia: "I have a bad feeling about this..."

2154
02:40:52,000 --> 02:40:55,000
*She is nervous; I can't blame her, though.*

2155
02:40:55,000 --> 02:40:59,000
Virgil: "Let's be careful. Remember, no need to engage in combat."

2156
02:40:59,000 --> 02:41:01,000
Narrator: "Everyone nodded."

2157
02:41:01,000 --> 02:41:05,000
Shael: "My night vision is excellent; I'll go ahead."

2158
02:41:05,000 --> 02:41:09,000
Virgil: "Yes. I'll stay at the back in case they ambush us."

2159
02:41:09,000 --> 02:41:14,000
*It sounds cowardly, but Laia and Rowen had almost no experience fighting.*

2160
02:41:14,000 --> 02:41:21,000
*Not like I am an expert, but I've been training... and, after all, I am responsible for the party.*

2161
02:41:21,000 --> 02:41:22,000
Shael: "Good idea."

2162
02:41:22,000 --> 02:41:23,000
*...*

2163
02:41:23,000 --> 02:41:27,000
Narrator: "As the group entered the cave, they found... nothing."

2164
02:41:27,000 --> 02:41:31,000
Virgil: "These tunnels, they seem to run deep, don't they?"

2165
02:41:31,000 --> 02:41:38,000
Shael: "Yes. Let's hurry then, or we might have to spend the night inside. An awful idea, of course."

2166
02:41:38,000 --> 02:41:41,000
Rowen: "I should have brought a weapon with me..."

2167
02:41:41,000 --> 02:41:44,000
Laia: "Can't you turn your body into one?"

2168
02:41:44,000 --> 02:41:48,000
Rowen: "Well... not quite, but don't worry, I can improvise."

2169
02:41:48,000 --> 02:41:53,000
Narrator: "Although faintly, the voices were echoing through the cavern."

2170
02:41:53,000 --> 02:41:57,000
Shael: "Hear that? Keep quiet now, or they'll find us."

2171
02:41:57,000 --> 02:42:06,000
Narrator: "Everyone agreed silently, and then they proceeded to get deeper into the complex tunnel system they had in front of them."

2172
02:42:06,000 --> 02:42:07,000
*......*

2173
02:42:07,000 --> 02:42:08,000
*...*

2174
02:42:08,000 --> 02:42:16,000
Narrator: "The group ventures inside, and although the signs are subtle, there is some evidence that people are living inside."

2175
02:42:16,000 --> 02:42:21,000
Narrator: "The group advances carefully, being wary of every step they make."

2176
02:42:21,000 --> 02:42:24,000
Narrator: "...Or so, that's why they thought."

2177
02:42:24,000 --> 02:42:25,000
Rowen: "Uh?!"

2178
02:42:25,000 --> 02:42:29,000
Narrator: "Without them realizing, they had stepped into a trap."

2179
02:42:29,000 --> 02:42:31,000
Rowen: "W-What's going on?!"

2180
02:42:31,000 --> 02:42:37,000
Narrator: "The floor was caving in, and the lecherous companion was about to fall inside of it."

2181
02:42:37,000 --> 02:42:39,000
Virgil: "Quickly, grab my-"

2182
02:42:39,000 --> 02:42:46,000
Narrator: "When he approached to help, the floor gave in, even more, making the two of them fall."

2183
02:42:46,000 --> 02:42:47,000
*...*

2184
02:42:47,000 --> 02:42:50,000
Narrator: "Everything went black for a moment."

2185
02:42:50,000 --> 02:42:52,000
Rowen: "Virgil? Are you alright?"

2186
02:42:52,000 --> 02:42:55,000
Narrator: "He could hear Rowen behind him."

2187
02:42:55,000 --> 02:42:59,000
Laia: "Don't worry! We'll take you out soon; just stay put!"

2188
02:42:59,000 --> 02:43:02,000
