2473
03:02:14,000 --> 03:02:18,000
Narrator: "Once outside, there was still no sign of the cult."

2474
03:02:18,000 --> 03:02:28,000
Narrator: "Laia, Shael, the girl, and Virgil returned to the city in record time, using Laia's magic to keep their stamina up and barely resting."

2475
03:02:28,000 --> 03:02:35,000
Narrator: "When they arrived, Laia took the girl to the Guild, while Shael and Virgil went to the temple. "

2476
03:02:35,000 --> 03:02:36,000
*......*

2477
03:02:36,000 --> 03:02:37,000
*...*

2478
03:02:37,000 --> 03:02:43,000
Narrator: "As the two adventurers arrived at the temple, Beatrice quickly approached them."

2479
03:02:43,000 --> 03:02:51,000
Narrator: "By the hastiness of their return, and their expression, she could tell that things didn't go as expected."

2480
03:02:51,000 --> 03:02:55,000
Beatrice: "Shael, Virgil, are you alright? And the others?"

2481
03:02:55,000 --> 03:02:56,000
