2497
03:04:03,000 --> 03:04:09,000
Beatrice: "Perhaps, so please, keep this between us... Although I will talk with Ava too."

2498
03:04:09,000 --> 03:04:18,000
Beatrice: "We might have to coordinate our efforts again, so I hope this experience has helped your group and Shael to get closer."

2499
