2500
03:04:20,000 --> 03:04:27,000
*She isn't that happy, but she didn't complain, which is a surprise considering all the things we did...*

2501
03:04:27,000 --> 03:04:39,000
Beatrice: "Great. Then, for now, let's wait for Rowen's return so that we can learn more about the cult; perhaps that will shed some light about what they were doing to that poor girl."

2502
03:04:39,000 --> 03:04:44,000
Virgil: "Mmh... Very well. Now I'll go back home; this excursion was exhausting."

2503
03:04:44,000 --> 03:04:50,000
