2507
03:05:05,000 --> 03:05:09,000
Beatrice: "It's the equivalent to $500; make good use of it."

2508
03:05:09,000 --> 03:05:11,000
Virgil: "$500?! That's a lot!"

2509
03:05:11,000 --> 03:05:18,000
Beatrice: "For a civilian perhaps, but you will soon that enhancing your party can be quite expensive."

2510
03:05:18,000 --> 03:05:22,000
Virgil: "Is that so? Well... then I appreciate the help."

2511
03:05:22,000 --> 03:05:24,000
Beatrice: "You are welcome. "

2512
03:05:24,000 --> 03:05:28,000
Beatrice: "Now, Shael, come with me; we need to talk."

2513
03:05:28,000 --> 03:05:29,000
Shael: "Yes, ma'am."

2514
03:05:29,000 --> 03:05:35,000
Narrator: "The two women left quickly, probably to continue talking about what just happened."

2515
03:05:35,000 --> 03:05:41,000
*Alba said something about the inquisition... I need to inform Ava as soon as possible. *

2516
03:05:41,000 --> 03:05:43,000
