2570
03:08:56,000 --> 03:09:03,000
Narrator: "Virgil was forced to approach, and unable to stop himself, his hand moved into the light."

2571
03:09:03,000 --> 03:09:09,000
Narrator: "When it entered, a flash of light illuminated the whole room, blinding him."

2572
03:09:09,000 --> 03:09:20,000
Narrator: "A few moments later, the huge magic pressure he was feeling a few moments ago was gone, but the being was still there, although it had calmed down."

2573
03:09:20,000 --> 03:09:22,000
*?????" "Full... rest now...*

2574
03:09:22,000 --> 03:09:27,000
*What the fuck happened... but at least I am not being overwhelmed anymore.*

2575
03:09:27,000 --> 03:09:30,000
*I need to go and see if everyone is okay.*

2576
03:09:30,000 --> 03:09:36,000
Narrator: "The champion rushed upstairs. There, Ava was on the floor, about to pass out."

2577
03:09:36,000 --> 03:09:38,000
Virgil: "Ava, are you alright?!"

2578
03:09:38,000 --> 03:09:40,000
Ava: "Virgil... what happened?!"

2579
03:09:40,000 --> 03:09:43,000
Virgil: "I dealt with the magic... I think."

2580
03:09:43,000 --> 03:09:45,000
Ava: "What are you... talking about?"

2581
03:09:45,000 --> 03:09:47,000
