2642
03:14:14,000 --> 03:14:17,000
Virgil: "Will everyone affected by this recover?"

2643
03:14:17,000 --> 03:14:25,000
Tamara: "Yes, I'd say it is very likely they won't even remember what happened. Magic like this often has that effect."

2644
03:14:25,000 --> 03:14:28,000
Virgil: "Well, that's a relief, I guess."

2645
03:14:28,000 --> 03:14:32,000
Virgil: "I feel drained, though, so I'll go back to sleep."

2646
03:14:32,000 --> 03:14:35,000
Tamara: "Heh, understandable. Take care, Virgil."

2647
03:14:35,000 --> 03:14:41,000
Narrator: "Our hero went back to his house, wondering about what he would have to do next."

2648
03:14:41,000 --> 03:14:47,000
